<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN HARDCOURT CHAMPIONSHIP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results</p>
<p>in the Australian hardcourt tennis championship on Friday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Andrei Cherkasov (Russia) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>4-Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat 5-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 6-4</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Jeff Tarango (U.S.) beat Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) 6-1 6-7 (2-7)</p>
<p>7-6 (17-15)</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat Karol Kucera (Slovakia) 6-4 7-5.</p>
</text>
